<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Volvo Novum&quot;,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Good Morning/Afternoon,</span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Volvo Novum&quot;,sans-serif"><b>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </b></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Volvo Novum&quot;,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">In accordance with your request to novate your finance agreement, we are pleased to attach your novation documents. To prevent delay, please use the checklist included to ensure we receive correct documentation back.</span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
Important : Please do check all paperwork has the correct customer details and asset information.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Volvo Novum&quot;,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Please arrange for a copy of Novation Agreement to be signed by the Original Customer and the New Customer:</span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
&nbsp;
<ul>
	<li><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Volvo Novum&quot;,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">if a sole proprietor, by such person</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Volvo Novum&quot;,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">if a partnership, by all partners</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Volvo Novum&quot;,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">if a company, by a director </span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
</ul>
<br />
<span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Volvo Novum&quot;,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Please do not date the agreement; Volvo Financial Services will date them when they have been signed by all parties. </span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Volvo Novum&quot;,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">The Administration Fee for the novation will be payable by the New Customer on receipt of Volvo Financial Services’ invoice. </span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Volvo Novum&quot;,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">When all parties have signed the agreement, Volvo Financial Services will forward one copy to the Original Customer and one to the New Customer.</span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Volvo Novum&quot;,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">If you have any questions with regards to the above please do not hesitate to contact Customer Services on 01926 401203</span></span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"> / </span></span></span><a href="mailto:adm.vfs.uk@vfsco.com" style="font-family:&quot;Volvo Novum&quot;,sans-serif; color:#8dc9bf; text-decoration:underline"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">adm.vfs.uk@vfsco.com</span></span></a><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">.</span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
&nbsp;
</body></html>